#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:37
msgid ""
"**assertions** — statements published as prose in the documentation, for the "
"freeports engine under ``docs/source/validation/assertions``: files of type"
msgstr ""
"**asserções** — afirmações publicadas em prosa na documentação, para o motor "
"freeports sob ``docs/source/validation/assertions``: arquivos do tipo"

#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:40
msgid "``.rst``"
msgstr "``.rst``"

#: ../../source/validation/general_methodology.rst:41
